<title>HUNGARY: SPT, Komercni push CESI index to third high.</title>
<headline>SPT, Komercni push CESI index to third high.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index jumped to a new high at 1,510.27 points, up 3.50 points or 0.223 percent on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index rose to its third new high propelled primarily by the gains in heavy-weight Czech shares, telecom company SPT Telecom and Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
</text>
